${JSON.stringify(actionable, null, 2)}

Verify with bunx tsc --noEmit and report real output.`,
    { label: 'apply-corrections', phase: 'Review', schema: EXEC_SCHEMA },
  )
} else {
  log('review: ship')
}

// ---- Gate: final honest verification ----------------------------------------
phase('Gate')
const gate = await agent(
  `${REPO}

Final verification gate. Run, in order: bun install (if node_modules is missing),
bunx tsc --noEmit, bunx eve build, and bunx eve eval (skip eval with an honest note if
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY is not configured). Fix NOTHING — only run and report the real results,
including failures verbatim (trimmed).`,
  { label: 'gate', schema: GATE_SCHEMA },
)

