  ```bash filename="Terminal"
  mkdir ai-text-demo
  cd ai-text-demo
  pnpm init
  ```

- ### Install dependencies
  Install the AI SDK and development dependencies:
  #### npm
  ```bash filename="Terminal"
  npm install ai@latest dotenv @types/node tsx typescript
  ```
  #### yarn
